{"version":1,"content":"<p>「美人魚冠軍」練樂儀（Alina）早前生日，現在沒有拍拖單身的她，別開生面舉行了一個單身生日派對，在全海景私人會所舉行，廣邀「單身狗」朋友一同慶祝，多位《女神配對計劃》的求愛勇者齊現身，包括《女神2》的關經翰(Oswald)、連續參加兩屆《</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:22:18.295202+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:01:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:18:34.174564+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:18:34.174564+00:00","content_hash":"9bd621304c016db57558839bcb89e803fdd72f2ee2a1f548f22dc5e7b79e9ea2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}